        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBHDCR9, Modern Right Corner HD Wire Basket</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStylish as it is functional, Deltana's HD Right Corner Wire Basket is perfect for homes with modern decor. The WBHDCR9 HD Wire Basket is useful to store anything from hand soap to shampoo, or even books or spices. The shelf is designed to utilize often wasted corner space. It easily mounts to the wall and is made out of solid brass. It is available in satin nickel or polished chrome finishes; and it is made with the attention to high quality that is expected of Deltana. Never have storage issues again!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBHDCR9-specifications.gif?v=1704354598\" width=\"535\" height=\"322\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WBHDCR9 9\" HD Right Corner Basket Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/9-inch-hd-universal-corner-bathroom-basket-deltana-wbhduc9\"><b>Deltana WBHDUC9 9 Inch HD Universal Corner Bathroom Basket</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/9-inch-hd-left-corner-bathroom-basket-deltana-wbhdcl9\"><b>Deltana WBHDCL9 9 Inch HD Left Corner Bathroom Basket</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/collections/bathroom-hardware-1\"><b>Deltana Wire Baskets</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the WBHDCR9 Solid Brass Modern Corner Shelf:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Shelf Length (right side): 9-1/4\" x 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Shelf Length (left side): 8-5/8\" x 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBHDCR9.pdf?v=1704262292\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WBHDCR9 9\" HD Right Corner Basket Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 basket, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
